    "summaryAr": "Weflow's Revenue AI Platform automates Salesforce data capture and gives full visibility into deal, pipeline, and forecast health. 300+ fast-growing companies like Retool, Abridge, and IDnow use Weflow to improve team productivity, sales performance, and revenue predictability. Weflow is backed by Gradient Ventures, Cherry Ventures, Eurazeo, and renowned angel investors, and run by repeat founders Philipp Stelzer and",
    "descriptionAr": "Weflow's Revenue AI Platform automates Salesforce data capture and gives full visibility into deal, pipeline, and forecast health. 300+ fast-growing companies like Retool, Abridge, and IDnow use Weflow to improve team productivity, sales performance, and revenue predictability. Weflow is backed by Gradient Ventures, Cherry Ventures, Eurazeo, and renowned angel investors, and run by repeat founders Philipp Stelzer and Janis Zech. Tasks We're building a partner ecosystem with private equity at its core. A single relationship with the right operating partner can open doors across dozens of portfolio companies, while RevOps agencies and CRM implementation partners source deals and deliver rollouts at scale. As Head of Partnerships, you'll own this channel end to end, working directly with Janis (CEO & Co-Founder) and the GTM team to turn partners into a repeatable source of pipeline and revenue. Tasks Build and own Weflow's PE partnership strategy, targeting firms, operating partners, and portfolio-ops leaders whose portfolios fit our ICP Structure commercial models for PE partnerships, including portfolio-wide rollouts, preferred-vendor arrangements, and referral agreements Grow our program with RevOps agencies and CRM implementation partners, covering recruitment, enablement, partner economics, and joint go-to-market Connect PE firms with the right implementation partners to deliver portfolio-wide rollouts quickly and consistently Partner with sales, marketing, and product to convert relationships into qualified pipeline and build supporting assets such as ROI cases and portfolio playbooks Represent Weflow at PE events, portfolio summits, and partner networks Establish playbooks and reporting that make partnerships a measurable, scalable part of our GTM engine Requirements Experience in private equity, portfolio operations, strategy consulting, or a role working closely with PE operating partners or portfolio leadership Proven track record building or scaling a partnership function in B2B SaaS, ideally including agencies or systems integrators Strong commercial acumen with experience structuring and negotiating partnership deals Excellent communication skills and credibility with operating partners, agency founders, and CROs Ability to build a function from the ground up and set its strategy Familiarity with Salesforce, RevOps, or the CRM ecosystem is a strong plus Willingness to travel frequently is a must Based in London or NYC is a plus Fluent in English Benefits Remote-first company setup Regular in-person meetups Top-of-the-line equipment Experienced, distributed, and diverse team Competitive package including stock options We look forward to hearing from you! We value diversity of perspective and seek to build an inclusive workplace that welcomes people from all backgrounds. Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow",
