    "summaryAr": "Why work at Higgsfield AI? Higgsfield AI is the fastest-scaling generative AI company in history, hitting $700M in annual revenue run rate, 30M+ users worldwide, 6M+ generations per day, and powering 390 of Fortune 500 brands. We write a lot, and it's read by millions of people around the world. Our content team is already strong, and now we want to make it stronger. You'll be the native voice of the brand: everythin",
    "descriptionAr": "Why work at Higgsfield AI? Higgsfield AI is the fastest-scaling generative AI company in history, hitting $700M in annual revenue run rate, 30M+ users worldwide, 6M+ generations per day, and powering 390 of Fortune 500 brands. We write a lot, and it's read by millions of people around the world. Our content team is already strong, and now we want to make it stronger. You'll be the native voice of the brand: everything our users read will go through you. What you will work on Reviewing and editing the team's copy across the blog, Help Center, changelog, Creator Hub, case studies, PR and news, newsletters, product updates, and UI text; Fact-checking every piece before it ships: checking model and feature names against the product; Keeping facts consistent across every surface, so the same number reads the same in the blog, Help Center, landing pages, and press releases; Shaping content for AI answers: a direct answer up front, question-based headings, useful FAQs, and internal links; Keeping the writing alive and human, with no traces of AI or template-speak; Working on tone, rhythm and clarity, not just fixing grammar; Writing your own pieces too, including editorial work like our Inside Higgsfield series; Holding one consistent brand voice across everything we publish. Your must haves English as your native language; A strong background in editing and writing, with a portfolio to show for it; An instinct for style, tone and rhythm. You feel when a sentence works and when it doesn't; The ability to explain your edits and how they make the text stronger. \"It sounds better\" is a start, not an answer; An owner mindset: you see what could be better, and you make it happen; Comfort with startup pace. We move fast, ship weekly, and the writing has to keep up. Nice to have Experience editing for a tech, SaaS or AI product; Experience building or maintaining a style guide or brand voice; Familiarity with the GenAI landscape and the tools creators actually use; The deal Competitive salary in USD; Fully remote position; Access to Higgsfield products and the AI tools we use internally; Full-time position with high ownership and growth potential. Find more English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow",
